Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Title,,0,0,0,,Dress Up Camera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs29\pos(276,539)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.65,0:00:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mud is all over my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, getting soaked by rain is not good for your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy now! Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment... Please look! Daddy! Don't you like this lovely coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is! But I have no money now. Let's buy it next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, your shirt is dirty once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.19,0:00:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You wore it on just moments ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.74,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be considerate about your mother as well, from next time!.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather inside the home is bad as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Change in to these!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you dirty your shirt again, you'll have no dress to wear!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dirty from head to toe! Go and take a bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all daddy's fault, If only he had bought that coat for her...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.09,0:01:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you do something once again, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.39,0:01:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing really!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.98,0:01:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, she scolded me just now and this happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a shirt to wear, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dress Up Camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.69,0:01:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How to use that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of shirt would you like to wear, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a superman-like styled shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to wear a space suit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, your thoughts are so vivid as usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I went a little too over-board!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll draw the shirt now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer this shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Project the drawing in to camera and aim the shutter on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfectly align the shirt on your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then press the shutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake! The theory is very simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it only if you think of the game of lining bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can combine and metamorphose the bricks into different shapes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This uses the same logic as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.99,0:02:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We combined scattered dress numerators into the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can create any shirt I like?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, any design is okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend it to me for a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A costume for Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you draw me Circus Joker Monkey's dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! I'll gift Mum her favorite dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the magazine that has Mum's favorite coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, how could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this coat even when my pocket was empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A present for you, Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show off this camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get carried away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Black cat, don't you wish your skin and hair color was different?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you beautiful so that all other cats will envy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.07,0:03:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll present you a handsome dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He will look young, tall and handsome wearing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you two fitting dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,More lovely ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How girly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You look funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you wearing a girl's skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this Nobita's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare change our dresses to that of girls'?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait and see! We'll teach you a good lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.\N I won't do that next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl shouldn't do rough stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.55,0:04:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I'm not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Suneo took away my camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How hopeless are you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo is so full of himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This camera will help me fulfill my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel shy and don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Models!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be a fashion designer, so I'm studying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have also secretly....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,my real dream is to be a fashion model.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A fashion model?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take advantage of my strapping body of man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right? Let's host a fashion show!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll host a fashion show, a like of which, no one has ever seen before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies, you all need to choose your dresses one after another, while on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Great...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already placed various designs in the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How embrasasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant became naked. But how did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I switched the designs with a blank white paper.
